WEBVTT

00:00:15.865 --> 00:00:20.405
Seeing it for real like this,
it's really incredible.

00:00:20.405 --> 00:00:22.775
Like something out of a dream.

00:00:22.775 --> 00:00:24.945
It's too big...

00:00:24.945 --> 00:00:29.715
To think that we were fighting
that thing, and trying to defeat it.

00:00:29.715 --> 00:00:33.115
That look on your face doesn't suit you.

00:00:33.115 --> 00:00:39.425
Nobody up there has given up yet.
We have to believe, too.

00:00:43.365 --> 00:00:44.925
KO...

00:00:50.035 --> 00:00:54.245
Raina, I've calculated a rough figure
for the number of Ostrums,

00:00:54.245 --> 00:01:00.045
and Thanatos is about to send
around 6 billion Ostrums to Earth.

00:01:00.045 --> 00:01:01.645
That many?

00:01:01.645 --> 00:01:03.755
Don't tell me it's planning to force all mankind

00:01:03.755 --> 00:01:06.585
to go through Resonance,
and then absorb them.

00:01:06.585 --> 00:01:10.755
It's a human-wave tactic.
Or rather, since they're Dragons,

00:01:10.755 --> 00:01:13.155
I should say a "Dragon-wave" tactic.

00:01:13.155 --> 00:01:16.595
Who asked you to be so glib?

00:01:16.595 --> 00:01:20.605
Well, I figure each of us could
take on 2 billion of them,

00:01:20.605 --> 00:01:23.105
and beat them all, right?

00:01:23.105 --> 00:01:26.975
Huh? You're awful.

00:01:26.975 --> 00:01:28.805
That's crazy.

00:01:28.805 --> 00:01:30.245
Is it?

00:01:30.245 --> 00:01:33.645
You're with me, aren't you, Howling Star?

00:01:36.015 --> 00:01:37.415
Unbelievable.

00:01:37.415 --> 00:01:40.255
You're not serious.

00:01:40.255 --> 00:01:42.585
Well, should we turn back now, instead?

00:01:42.585 --> 00:01:44.595
- Who, me?
- Dream on.

00:01:44.595 --> 00:01:46.585
Save that talk for when you're asleep.

00:01:47.695 --> 00:01:49.995
Let's go, Amadeus!

00:01:52.965 --> 00:01:55.455
Otohime, off we go!

00:01:57.275 --> 00:01:59.265
Howling Star!

00:02:02.375 --> 00:02:05.875
S-Stop Thanatos using the Aegis?!

00:02:05.875 --> 00:02:08.945
Yes. If we reset it to maximum output,

00:02:08.945 --> 00:02:12.985
we might at least be able to buy them some time.

00:02:12.985 --> 00:02:16.555
Jin is still in there somewhere. Knowing him,

00:02:16.555 --> 00:02:19.295
he's sure to come through with something.

00:02:19.295 --> 00:02:22.485
I want to support Jin.

00:02:27.635 --> 00:02:29.205
W-What?!

00:02:29.205 --> 00:02:30.805
Nothing.

00:02:30.805 --> 00:02:32.635
Oh, brother...

00:02:35.475 --> 00:02:38.035
Just sit tight, Jin.

00:02:52.725 --> 00:02:57.435
Is there any way for us to persuade Thanatos?

00:02:57.435 --> 00:03:01.505
I don't know, but we have to try.

00:03:01.505 --> 00:03:07.875
To defend Earth, and begin a new
history for humans and Dragons.

00:03:07.875 --> 00:03:09.505
Jin...

00:03:31.635 --> 00:03:33.295
Look, Mama.

00:03:33.295 --> 00:03:35.065
The Dragonauts!

00:03:35.065 --> 00:03:37.965
It's not safe here.
Hurry and get to an evacuation shelter.

00:03:50.085 --> 00:03:53.985
Well, partner? How does it feel
to make a hero's comeback?

00:03:59.255 --> 00:04:01.625
How can this be?

00:04:01.625 --> 00:04:05.465
Is this the judgment that has befallen mankind?

00:04:05.465 --> 00:04:07.635
Sir, it is too dangerous here!

00:04:07.635 --> 00:04:09.465
Please, come down to the underground shelter!

00:04:23.615 --> 00:04:25.815
Father, hurry and get away!

00:04:25.815 --> 00:04:27.755
Young Miss!

00:04:27.755 --> 00:04:31.125
Johan, look after my father for me.

00:04:31.125 --> 00:04:32.825
You can count on me.

00:04:32.825 --> 00:04:34.655
Sigelinde...

00:04:36.265 --> 00:04:38.455
Amadeus, let's go!

00:04:47.105 --> 00:04:52.645
I don't understand.
Why do they resist as much as this?

00:04:52.645 --> 00:04:55.615
Why do they refuse to merge?

00:04:55.615 --> 00:04:59.455
The more we learn about them,
the more unique their intelligence is.

00:04:59.455 --> 00:05:03.025
As imperfect as they may be, for some reason,

00:05:03.025 --> 00:05:05.555
they stimulate great interest.

00:05:05.555 --> 00:05:08.725
Fear. Hatred. Despair.

00:05:08.725 --> 00:05:12.865
They are all emotions that we
experienced as a result of having

00:05:12.865 --> 00:05:16.565
feeble mental frameworks
locked inside bodies, long ago.

00:05:16.565 --> 00:05:22.805
By merging, they can be saved,
and become a part of the universe.

00:05:22.805 --> 00:05:27.215
Why can't they understand and accept that?

00:05:27.215 --> 00:05:31.915
Isn't it exactly because their vessels,
and the memories that fill them, are limited,

00:05:31.915 --> 00:05:35.725
that humans find inimitable worth in them?

00:05:35.725 --> 00:05:38.355
That is a unique point of view.

00:05:38.355 --> 00:05:43.495
The memories that I have as a
human say that people look weak,

00:05:43.495 --> 00:05:46.435
but are actually fairly resilient.

00:06:05.915 --> 00:06:09.525
Damn it, we can't get close
enough with so many of them!

00:06:09.525 --> 00:06:11.685
Allow me to help.

00:06:15.265 --> 00:06:16.895
Professor Nozaki!

00:06:16.895 --> 00:06:20.295
Toa, are you happy now?

00:06:23.435 --> 00:06:25.405
Yes.

00:06:25.405 --> 00:06:29.145
After going through Resonance,
I've long had my doubts.

00:06:29.145 --> 00:06:32.915
Were our feelings being brought
about because of the Resonance?

00:06:32.915 --> 00:06:36.915
In which case, are these feelings
of adoration for our partners

00:06:36.915 --> 00:06:40.725
not something that was manufactured?

00:06:40.725 --> 00:06:46.655
Do we not have our own
freedom of will, in any true sense?

00:06:58.805 --> 00:07:01.235
Otohime! Habaragi!

00:07:09.915 --> 00:07:12.685
But I've realized something.

00:07:12.685 --> 00:07:15.125
Whether they are manufactured,

00:07:15.125 --> 00:07:19.325
or whether they come forth
naturally, it doesn't matter.

00:07:19.325 --> 00:07:23.865
The important thing is that we
think of those feelings as genuine,

00:07:23.865 --> 00:07:26.865
and that we believe in ourselves.

00:07:26.865 --> 00:07:28.495
Professor...

00:07:30.375 --> 00:07:35.105
I've implanted the anti-Thanatos factor
from Laura inside my body.

00:07:35.105 --> 00:07:40.845
Now, I can act as an Annihilator,
and deliver a blow to Thanatos.

00:07:40.845 --> 00:07:43.215
Why would you do anything so rash?!

00:07:43.215 --> 00:07:45.685
Because there's someone I want to protect.

00:07:45.685 --> 00:07:47.885
Does that sound strange?

00:07:49.825 --> 00:07:52.125
No.

00:07:52.125 --> 00:07:54.165
I wanted to see where the future

00:07:54.165 --> 00:07:56.965
for people and Dragons led with my own eyes,

00:07:56.965 --> 00:08:01.205
but I will leave that to
the ties between you two.

00:08:01.205 --> 00:08:06.735
Make sure the two of you make
your feelings known to Mother.

00:08:06.735 --> 00:08:08.365
Professor!

00:08:12.645 --> 00:08:14.475
Professor Nozaki!

00:08:32.035 --> 00:08:33.655
Yuri...

00:08:41.605 --> 00:08:43.195
Professor!

00:08:45.675 --> 00:08:47.745
What's wrong?

00:08:47.745 --> 00:08:49.515
Just now...

00:08:56.285 --> 00:08:57.915
Professor...

00:09:11.435 --> 00:09:13.705
Gio!!

00:09:35.225 --> 00:09:38.095
Energy charge at 98%.

00:09:38.095 --> 00:09:41.165
Targeting Thanatos' head.

00:09:41.165 --> 00:09:43.065
Target lock on!

00:09:43.065 --> 00:09:45.165
Aegis irradiating!

00:10:03.125 --> 00:10:05.355
No good! It had no effect!

00:10:07.265 --> 00:10:10.995
This is bad. Several of the Ostrums
are headed for the Moon.

00:10:16.635 --> 00:10:18.005
The Moon...

00:10:18.005 --> 00:10:20.995
Aegis is destroyed.

00:10:22.445 --> 00:10:23.845
Ostrum approaching!

00:10:23.845 --> 00:10:26.105
T-Take evasive!

00:10:28.115 --> 00:10:29.675
Why, you!

00:10:47.665 --> 00:10:50.705
Thanatos' mind is up ahead.

00:10:50.705 --> 00:10:52.335
However...

00:10:56.975 --> 00:11:00.415
You're still alive, Ostrum?

00:11:03.415 --> 00:11:06.715
I've been waiting for you, Gio.

00:11:06.715 --> 00:11:10.725
Ostrum?! But I thought
we defeated him back then.

00:11:10.725 --> 00:11:14.025
You guys go on ahead. Let me handle him.

00:11:14.025 --> 00:11:16.165
Gio!

00:11:16.165 --> 00:11:17.855
Hurry up!

00:11:19.335 --> 00:11:20.895
All right.

00:11:24.035 --> 00:11:28.905
I'm going to pay you back now for
the humiliation you put me through.

00:11:28.905 --> 00:11:33.275
Did you know that's what beaten-down dogs say?

00:11:33.275 --> 00:11:35.045
Enough!

00:11:57.065 --> 00:12:03.405
1,999,999,900 to go, I guess.

00:12:05.645 --> 00:12:08.135
Okay, onto the next one.

00:12:31.505 --> 00:12:34.735
Young Miss, are you all right?

00:12:37.815 --> 00:12:39.435
Amadeus!

00:12:50.425 --> 00:12:52.825
Ltsuki! Otohime!

00:12:58.965 --> 00:13:01.625
Sigelinde! Ltsuki!

00:13:11.845 --> 00:13:13.645
Howling Star!

00:13:13.645 --> 00:13:16.685
What's with the long face, partner?

00:13:16.685 --> 00:13:19.455
You look like you're about to cry, you know.

00:13:19.455 --> 00:13:20.885
Don't be absurd.

00:13:20.885 --> 00:13:24.875
Hey, let us rest for a minute,
and we can continue the match.

00:13:26.055 --> 00:13:27.655
Yes.

00:13:29.865 --> 00:13:31.625
Guys...

00:13:32.695 --> 00:13:34.005
What?

00:13:34.005 --> 00:13:35.635
Are those?

00:13:35.635 --> 00:13:37.195
Ostrums?!

00:13:53.155 --> 00:13:57.555
Why don't you guys follow Mother's will?

00:13:57.555 --> 00:14:00.525
You are part of Mother, aren't you?

00:14:08.265 --> 00:14:10.065
Garnet!

00:14:10.065 --> 00:14:15.345
Why are you so attached
to that individual? Answer me.

00:14:15.345 --> 00:14:17.075
Because I love him.

00:14:18.875 --> 00:14:24.855
A fascinating thought.
I shall now question you...

00:14:24.855 --> 00:14:28.115
...to see if that feeling is genuine or not.

00:14:31.295 --> 00:14:36.095
There is no greater feeling
than to merge with Mother.

00:14:40.705 --> 00:14:43.065
Jin, be careful, okay?

00:14:43.065 --> 00:14:47.365
Yeah. Thanks for coming all
the way down here, Kazuki.

00:14:50.045 --> 00:14:52.145
Well, off I go.

00:14:52.145 --> 00:14:54.815
Get a good look for me, too.

00:14:54.815 --> 00:14:56.405
Sure.

00:14:59.455 --> 00:15:01.215
Kazuki...

00:15:03.485 --> 00:15:05.325
Widow!

00:15:05.325 --> 00:15:07.125
Your girlfriend's calling for you.

00:15:07.125 --> 00:15:08.925
Don't tease me like that!

00:15:08.925 --> 00:15:12.055
- Whew, you're all worked up!
- Knock it off, already!

00:15:26.145 --> 00:15:29.445
Toa-chan, no, don't take off your seatbelt!

00:15:35.085 --> 00:15:38.625
Whoa, Big Brother, how indecent!

00:15:38.625 --> 00:15:40.495
I-I'm sorry.

00:15:40.495 --> 00:15:42.965
N-Not at all.

00:15:42.965 --> 00:15:46.535
Oh my, you've found yourself
a handsome seatbelt, huh?

00:15:46.535 --> 00:15:48.965
- Sis!
- I-It's not like that!

00:15:48.965 --> 00:15:51.775
Come on, don't say things like that!

00:15:51.775 --> 00:15:55.445
Um, I'm sorry, I...

00:15:55.445 --> 00:15:57.875
No, I should apologize...

00:16:01.015 --> 00:16:04.145
Um, is something the matter?

00:16:07.985 --> 00:16:09.545
This is wrong.

00:16:12.295 --> 00:16:14.625
What, Big Brother?

00:16:14.625 --> 00:16:16.825
What's the matter, Jin?

00:16:16.825 --> 00:16:18.395
This is wrong.

00:16:18.395 --> 00:16:23.495
This isn't real. Mom, Ai...

00:16:25.035 --> 00:16:26.835
Big Brother...

00:16:26.835 --> 00:16:28.875
Jin...

00:16:28.875 --> 00:16:31.745
What's the matter, Jin?

00:16:31.745 --> 00:16:34.685
This is a fantasy, created by Thanatos,

00:16:34.685 --> 00:16:38.915
from my hopes of what I wish could happen.

00:16:38.915 --> 00:16:40.685
Jin...

00:16:41.985 --> 00:16:43.645
Jin!

00:16:47.025 --> 00:16:50.995
Jin, thank goodness, you realized!

00:16:50.995 --> 00:16:54.705
Thanks, Toa. I heard your voice.

00:16:54.705 --> 00:16:56.535
Why?

00:16:56.535 --> 00:17:01.075
Once you merge, you will be
released from all of your pain.

00:17:01.075 --> 00:17:05.015
That isn't what we want!

00:17:05.015 --> 00:17:09.015
Don't you understand?
By going through Resonance,

00:17:09.015 --> 00:17:14.755
we have changed. And now,
that change is coming upon you, too.

00:17:14.755 --> 00:17:17.225
I will not accept that.

00:17:17.225 --> 00:17:19.085
I will not change!

00:18:06.275 --> 00:18:10.445
We changed by going through
Resonance with humans.

00:18:10.445 --> 00:18:14.345
We obtained souls that allow us
to be concerned for others.

00:18:14.345 --> 00:18:19.315
Is that something we need?

00:18:19.315 --> 00:18:22.085
I'm glad I was born on this world.

00:18:22.085 --> 00:18:24.595
I gained a soul, learned of love,

00:18:24.595 --> 00:18:28.325
and spent time together with Jin and Toa.

00:18:28.325 --> 00:18:33.625
A soul... is that the difference
between you and I?

00:18:45.845 --> 00:18:49.715
Sure, humans are imperfect.
We always have this giant wound

00:18:49.715 --> 00:18:53.555
in the middle of our chests,
with blood pouring out of it.

00:18:53.555 --> 00:18:57.055
But that's what it is to be alive.

00:18:57.055 --> 00:19:01.665
Having everything reset,
and being lumped all together, like you are,

00:19:01.665 --> 00:19:04.025
means that in the end,
you're the only one there.

00:19:04.025 --> 00:19:05.565
There isn't anyone else around.

00:19:05.565 --> 00:19:07.665
What?

00:19:07.665 --> 00:19:12.075
I love the gentleness in
Jin's eyes when he looks at me.

00:19:12.075 --> 00:19:15.505
I love the sound of his voice
when he calls my name.

00:19:15.505 --> 00:19:18.815
I love the warmth of his body when he holds me.

00:19:18.815 --> 00:19:23.185
That is a feeling born of your
Resonance with each other!

00:19:23.185 --> 00:19:24.415
No, it isn't.

00:19:24.415 --> 00:19:27.215
I'm sure that even without our Resonance,

00:19:27.215 --> 00:19:29.855
I would have fallen in love with Jin.

00:19:29.855 --> 00:19:33.385
Me, too. I fell in love with Toa
because of who she is.

00:19:34.995 --> 00:19:37.825
So we don't have any need to merge.

00:19:40.935 --> 00:19:44.235
We are not alone.

00:20:16.105 --> 00:20:17.695
What is this?

00:20:25.715 --> 00:20:29.085
Are you saying that I'm alone?

00:20:29.085 --> 00:20:31.755
You're just now realizing it?

00:20:31.755 --> 00:20:33.475
I'm...

00:20:42.595 --> 00:20:44.255
What the...

00:20:46.235 --> 00:20:47.825
Mother.

00:20:51.275 --> 00:20:53.335
You are Thanatos?

00:20:53.335 --> 00:20:57.775
You win, human.

00:20:57.775 --> 00:21:03.815
Apparently, I have spent
far too much time alone.

00:21:03.815 --> 00:21:08.525
I will consider, as I am
headed to my next world,

00:21:08.525 --> 00:21:11.255
what it means to love.

00:21:11.255 --> 00:21:12.795
Mother,

00:21:12.795 --> 00:21:14.525
are you smiling?

00:21:33.945 --> 00:21:35.945
What the hell is going on?

00:21:35.945 --> 00:21:37.685
Isn't it obvious?

00:21:37.685 --> 00:21:39.985
Those two managed to do it.

00:21:39.985 --> 00:21:43.815
Young Miss, how wonderful!

00:21:45.155 --> 00:21:47.755
Look. Thanatos is...

00:21:53.695 --> 00:21:53.995
Someday, I shall visit this world again.

00:21:53.995 --> 00:21:58.635
In my younger days, I lost
