When that happens, I do not know whether or not

00:21:59.705 --> 00:22:01.305
even the reason for this pain
When that happens, I do not know whether or not

00:22:01.305 --> 00:22:05.375
even the reason for this pain
it will be you humans who will greet me.

00:22:05.375 --> 00:22:05.575
Even the reason for this pain
