00:22:10.045 --> 00:22:11.255
Crouching over, making excuses
that I will be disappointed.

00:22:11.255 --> 00:22:14.485
I must have...
that I will be disappointed.

00:22:14.485 --> 00:22:15.385
That I will be disappointed.

00:22:15.885 --> 00:22:22.195
Taking hold of the premonition
I saw at the end of the blue,

00:22:22.195 --> 00:22:28.505
riding the wind, I'm off
to where the light shines

00:22:28.505 --> 00:22:29.765
riding the wind, I'm off
