Jin!

00:22:29.765 --> 00:22:30.065
I'll always be with you
Jin!

00:22:30.065 --> 00:22:32.675
I'll always be with you

00:22:32.675 --> 00:22:35.175
see the sky in front of you

00:22:35.175 --> 00:22:39.545
fly high in a light from the deepest blue

00:22:41.345 --> 00:22:44.585
Riding the echo of swirling stars,

00:22:44.585 --> 00:22:46.885
Riding the echo of swirling stars,
Farewell, Gio.

00:22:46.885 --> 00:22:47.415
I sing out
Farewell, Gio.

00:22:47.415 --> 00:22:49.555
I sing out

00:22:49.555 --> 00:22:58.225
May my voice reach you

00:23:44.475 --> 00:23:47.805
- We are...
- We are...

00:23:52.185 --> 00:23:53.945
...not alone.
